# NSMBW Rust port: boot to the World 1 map and enter a course (the start of 1-1.press).
# With --course, the course entered becomes the one asked for:
#   nsmbw-port --unpaced --press-file scripts/to-map.press --course 3-24 --frames 7600
# Needs an existing save in file 1 (otherwise the save-data prompt shifts every frame below).

# Strap screen, title, file select, Select Players, opening cutscene.
600:a 1550:2 2600:2 3000:2 3400:2
# Walk out of the castle to the World 1 map, then enter the course under the cursor (1-1).
5150:down:900 6100:2
